  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PROTECTION OF CULTURAL PROPERTY IN THE EVENT OF ARMED CONFLIT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this Special Account is to receive contributions from the countries concerned and sums allocated by the Organization to be used both for the payment of the salaries and expenses of the Commissioners-General in accordance with Article 10 of the Regulations for the Execution of the Conventions for the Protection of Cultural Property in the Event of Armed Conflict, and for Ensuring action by UNESCO under Article 23 of this Convention.</narrative>
  </description>
